{
	"_comment": [
		"Hand-written Kazakh for the strings HikaShop has no word for. Merged over the ones taken from",
		"HikaShop's own kz-KZ file by tools/build-locales.mjs, so regenerating keeps these.",
		"Kazakh counts in two, and the noun does not change after a numeral: 5 нұсқа, not 5 нұсқалар.",
		"Cyrillic, with the Kazakh letters Ә Ғ Қ Ң Ө Ұ Ү Һ І that Russian does not have.",
		"Marked needs-native-check, and meant literally: this was written without a native speaker",
		"reading it. It gives a merchant their own words rather than English, but it is one of the",
		"two languages here I can vouch for least. Corrections go in this file; run",
		"tools/build-locales.mjs and the app picks them up."
	],
